      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Take the BoneSpaceTransforms array (translation vector, rotation quaternion and scale vector) and update the array of component-space bone transformation matrices (SpaceBases).\nIt will work down hierarchy multiplying the component-space transform of the parent by the relative transform of the child.\nThis code also applies any per-bone rotators etc. as part of the composition process"
